Ryovia Watch Page — Project Purpose

This repository contains only the Ryovia watch-page user interface. It is
published for developers and designers who want to study, redesign, and improve
the page experience. It does not include a video playback backend, streaming
implementation, private API logic, provider integration, or hosted media.

This purpose notice does not replace or restrict the open-source license below.
Third-party names, artwork, and other assets remain the property of their
respective owners and are not relicensed by this repository.

